    "hero": {
      "type": "jewelry-collections-overview",
      "name": "Personalized Jewelry · Hero",
      "settings": {
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "use_background": true,
        "background_color": "#f8f7f4",
        "text_color": "#17191a",
        "accent_color": "#c7a85e",
        "eyebrow": "CUSTOM / PERSONALIZED JEWELRY",
        "heading": "Custom Personalized Jewelry Manufacturer",
        "introduction": "<p>Develop meaningful jewelry collections for your brand with personalized initials, names, birthstones, zodiac symbols and significant numbers. Craftaurum works with designers, brands and wholesale partners to transform individual stories into jewelry ready for a broader market.</p><p>We support custom concept development, material selection, sampling and coordinated production so each design aligns with your brand’s style and requirements.</p>",
        "hero_image": "shopify://shop_images/custom-letters-jewelry.jpg",
        "image_position": "right",
        "image_ratio": "landscape",
        "quote_label": "Contact Us",
        "quote_url": "shopify://pages/contact",
        "catalog_label": "",
        "catalog_url": "",
        "eyebrow_size": 12,
        "heading_size": 58,
        "body_size": 16,
        "animation_style": "fade-in",
        "padding_top": 56,
        "padding_bottom": 64
      }
    },
    "special": {
      "type": "image-text-feature",
      "name": "Custom Special Jewelry",
      "settings": {
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "background_color": "#ffffff",
        "text_color": "#17191a",
        "accent_color": "#c7a85e",
        "heading": "Custom Special Jewelry",
        "heading_size": 35,
        "subtitle_size": 12,
        "body_size": 16,
        "animation_style": "fade-up",
        "heading_position": "content",
        "subtitle": "",
        "top_label": "",
        "top_url": "",
        "top_button_style": "button",
        "body": "<p>Personalized jewelry often marks the moments people remember most. Engagement rings, anniversary gifts, graduation pieces and keepsakes for a new child can all become lasting expressions of connection and personal style.</p><p>Craftaurum helps brands explore custom jewelry sets, meaningful motifs and design details suited to commemorative collections, from initial concepts and material options to samples and finished pieces.</p>",
        "image": "",
        "image_position": "right",
        "image_ratio": "landscape",
        "cta_label": "",
        "cta_url": "",
        "cta_button_style": "button-unstyled",
        "padding_top": 80,
        "padding_bottom": 40
      }
    },
    "enamel": {
      "type": "image-text-feature",
      "name": "Custom Enamel Jewelry",
      "settings": {
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "background_color": "#f8f7f4",
        "text_color": "#17191a",
        "accent_color": "#c7a85e",
        "heading": "Custom Enamel Jewelry",
        "heading_size": 35,
        "subtitle_size": 12,
        "body_size": 16,
        "animation_style": "soft-zoom",
        "heading_position": "content",
        "subtitle": "",
        "top_label": "",
        "top_url": "",
        "top_button_style": "button",
        "body": "<p>Enamel adds expressive color to rings, pendants, earrings and other personalized jewelry. Whether your concept uses a subtle accent or vivid multicolor detailing, enamel can bring a distinctive visual identity to a collection.</p><p>We can discuss design feasibility, metal foundations, color placement and finishing considerations as part of a customized jewelry development project.</p>",
        "image": "",
        "image_position": "left",
        "image_ratio": "landscape",
        "cta_label": "",
        "cta_url": "",
        "cta_button_style": "button-unstyled",
        "padding_top": 80,
        "padding_bottom": 40
      }
    },
