        "heading": "Unlock Custom Meaningful Jewelry Elements for Your Brand",
        "description": "<p>Explore four core directions for meaningful collections: gemstones, initials, zodiac motifs and important numbers. Each can be tailored through design, materials and finishes.</p>",
        "heading_size": 35,
        "body_size": 16,
