    "initial": {
      "type": "image-text-feature",
      "name": "Initial Jewelry Wholesale Manufacturer",
      "settings": {
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "background_color": "#ffffff",
        "text_color": "#17191a",
        "accent_color": "#c7a85e",
        "heading": "Initial Jewelry Wholesale Manufacturer",
        "heading_size": 35,
        "subtitle_size": 12,
        "body_size": 16,
        "animation_style": "fade-up",
        "heading_position": "content",
        "subtitle": "",
        "top_label": "",
        "top_url": "",
        "top_button_style": "button",
        "body": "<p>Initial and name jewelry gives customers the ability to wear something distinctly their own. Craftaurum supports brand-led development of initial necklaces, monogram pendants, nameplate necklaces, bracelets and coordinating jewelry sets.</p><p>Discuss your preferred letterforms, metal finish, accent stones, sizing and collection scope with our team. We can help refine the design direction for sampling and planned wholesale quantities.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/custom-inital-necklace.jpg",
        "image_position": "right",
        "image_ratio": "landscape",
        "cta_label": "",
        "cta_url": "",
        "cta_button_style": "button-unstyled",
        "padding_top": 80,
        "padding_bottom": 40
      }
    },
    "birthstone": {
      "type": "image-text-feature",
      "name": "Custom Birthstone Jewelry Manufacturer",
      "settings": {
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "background_color": "#f8f7f4",
        "text_color": "#17191a",
        "accent_color": "#c7a85e",
        "heading": "Custom Birthstone Jewelry Manufacturer",
        "heading_size": 35,
        "subtitle_size": 12,
        "body_size": 16,
        "animation_style": "soft-zoom",
        "heading_position": "content",
        "subtitle": "",
        "top_label": "",
        "top_url": "",
        "top_button_style": "button",
        "body": "<p>Birthstone jewelry gives each piece an emotional connection to a birth month or a personal milestone. For jewelry brands, gemstones create possibilities for seasonal gifting as well as year-round necklaces, earrings, rings and bracelets.</p><p>Explore coordinated styles and gemstone color directions, then discuss practical setting details, available materials and sampling for your intended collection.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Custom-birthstone-jewelry.jpg",
        "image_position": "left",
        "image_ratio": "landscape",
        "cta_label": "Start Your Project",
        "cta_url": "shopify://pages/contact",
        "cta_button_style": "button-unstyled",
        "padding_top": 80,
        "padding_bottom": 40
      }
    },
    "zodiac": {
      "type": "image-text-feature",
      "name": "Zodiac Jewelry Custom",
      "settings": {
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "background_color": "#ffffff",
        "text_color": "#17191a",
        "accent_color": "#c7a85e",
        "heading": "Zodiac Jewelry Custom",
        "heading_size": 35,
        "subtitle_size": 12,
        "body_size": 16,
        "animation_style": "fade-up",
        "heading_position": "content",
        "subtitle": "",
        "top_label": "",
        "top_url": "",
        "top_button_style": "button",
        "body": "<p>Offer customers a personal connection to their astrological sign through zodiac symbols, constellation details and celestial jewelry designs. Motifs can be translated into necklaces, pendants, charms, bracelets and earrings.</p><p>Craftaurum can work with your artwork to develop a consistent visual language across the twelve signs and explore additional customization through engraving, lettering or gemstone details.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/custom-zodiac-jewelry.jpg",
        "image_position": "right",
        "image_ratio": "landscape",
        "cta_label": "Contact Us",
        "cta_url": "shopify://pages/contact",
